window.FT_DAY_DECKS = {"1":{"day":1,"title":"VA Essentials","heading":"DAY 1 VA Essentials","slides":[{"id":"hubstaff","h":"Hubstaff To-Do Set-up (Daily Requirement)","html":"<p>Trainees must set their HS To-Dos daily using the following templates:</p>\n<p><b>Daily To-Do Templates</b></p>\n<div class=\"naming\">\n  <div>[Session Type + Schedule Day]: [Program Name] – [Module Day]</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"naming\">\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion : Virtual Assistant Essentials - Day 1</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion: Virtual Assistant Essentials - Day 2</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion: Reception Training Day 1</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion: Reception Training Day 2</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion: Reception Training Day 3</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion: Calendar Management Training</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion: Intake Training Day 1</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Shadowing Intake Specialist Role (Arlene)</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion: Intake Training Day 2</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion: Intake Training Day 3</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion: Insurance Communication Training Day 1</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion: Insurance Communication Training Day 2</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Shadowing Insurance Communication Role (Edward)</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion: Insurance Communication Training Day 3</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion: Provider Communication Training Day 1</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion: Provider Communication Training Day 2</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion: Provider Communication Training Day 3</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Shadowing Provider Communication Role (Vince)</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion: Provider Communication Training Day 4</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Shadowing Provider Communication Role (Allesa)</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion:  Lien Negotiator Training Day 1</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Classroom Discussion: Lien Negotiator Training Day 2</div>\n  <div>To-Do: Shadowing Lien Negotiator Role (Mario)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"1:hubstaff\"></div>"},{"id":"reading","h":"Reading Task: Personal Injury Cases (Overview: What is personal injury?) – to be completed w/in 2nd - 3rd hour of training day","html":"<p>A. Go to this link and read on to get a good grasp of what we do here in the firm.</p>\n<p class=\"url-list\"><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Personal Injury Cases (Overview: What is personal injury?)\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1VAn-xmcozdHqr-7pzpnY0Rlsc4-4T43O/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1VAn-xmcozdHqr-7pzpnY0Rlsc4-4T43O/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p>B. Answer the following questions:</p>\n<p class=\"plain-list\">\n  1. What is personal injury and what are its types?<br>\n  2. Can you enumerate the stages of a personal injury claim on your own understanding?<br>\n  3. How much is the common compensation for a personal injury claim?<br>\n  4. How long does it take for a personal injury case to resolve?<br>\n  5. What are the common factors that affect a personal injury case?<br>\n  6. What do you think are the advantages and disadvantages of pushing for a case to litigation (going to court)?\n</p>\n<p><b>Note: Please send you answers here in our group chat so we know that you are done. You may write your answers using WORD document or NOTEPAD and use this naming convention:</b></p>\n<div class=\"naming\"><div>PI Overview_Answers (VA’s name)</div></div>\n<p>Thank you.</p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"1:tettra\"></div>"},{"id":"discussion","h":"Classroom Discussion: Virtual Assistants Essentials Training","html":"<div class=\"canva-frame\" id=\"canvaFrame\">\n  <iframe\n    loading=\"lazy\"\n    title=\"Virtual Assistants Essentials (Canva)\"\n    src=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGnZTxmWyk/sLRwYE5XE5EhyZvY98iQ2Q/view?embed\"\n    allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"\n    allow=\"fullscreen\">\n  </iframe>\n</div>\n<div class=\"actions\">\n  <span></span>\n  <div class=\"btn-row\">\n    <button class=\"btn ghost\" type=\"button\" data-fullscreen=\"canvaFrame\">⛶ Full screen</button>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGnZTxmWyk/sLRwYE5XE5EhyZvY98iQ2Q/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open in Canva ↗</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cards\">\n  <div class=\"res-card lecture\" data-kind=\"lecture\" data-title=\"VA Essentials — Recorded Lecture\" data-url=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nar59ncUsmmmfFfxyxNLU54ImruHzahF/view\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">\n    <div class=\"res-head\">VA Essentials — Recorded Lecture</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"1:discussion-deck\"></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"ftdd-pq\">✍️ <b>Today’s Process Questions</b> are answered in <a class=\"ftdd-link\" onclick=\"goto('process')\">✍️ Knowledge Check</a>, after the day’s activities — not here.</div>\n"},{"id":"client-id","h":"Client Identification Exercise","html":"<div class=\"canva-frame\" id=\"clientIdFrame\">\n  <iframe\n    loading=\"lazy\"\n    title=\"Client Identification Exercise (Canva)\"\n    src=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGup_E9uu8/-KpA5LRHCi-uvrivrPv9EQ/view?embed\"\n    allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"\n    allow=\"fullscreen\">\n  </iframe>\n</div>\n<div class=\"actions\">\n  <span></span>\n  <div class=\"btn-row\">\n    <button class=\"btn ghost\" type=\"button\" data-fullscreen=\"clientIdFrame\">⛶ Full screen</button>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGup_E9uu8/-KpA5LRHCi-uvrivrPv9EQ/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open in Canva ↗</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},{"id":"monitoring","h":"Training Monitoring Sheet","html":"<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"1:monitoring\"></div>\n<ul>\n        <li>As soon as you are done with all the tasks, kindly download your monitoring sheet below and upload it to your respective trainees' folder. Once done, please update items #1-4. Thank you.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"1:monitoring-send\"></div>\n      <p class=\"url-list\"><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Naming Convention\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ty9HXeWRCxqM78quiiEHqFYxZwGeT9Uh/edit?usp=sharing&amp;amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;amp;rtpof=true&amp;amp;sd=true\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ty9HXeWRCxqM78quiiEHqFYxZwGeT9Uh/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true</a></p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Once you upload the training monitoring sheet to your individual trainee folder, make sure to edit and update it directly there instead of using a separate file. This is to ensure that you are working on them on time. If you've already edited the file I gave before uploading it to the folder, that's fine. Just upload the edited sheet and in the future, make edits directly in the uploaded file in your folder. It will save automatically as you edit. Thank you.</li>\n        <li>Update items 1-5 with the date when each topic was covered or discussed. When updating these items, make sure to provide all 5 takeaways -- not just 2, 3, or 4. Each takeaway should be written in complete sentences. A simple sentence will suffice, rather than just words or phrases. This also helps us to assess your writing skills as well. Thank you.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p><b>REMINDER:&nbsp; Please ensure that all 5 takeaways are provided, not just 3 or 4, and write your takeaways in complete sentences. This is one way to assess your writing skill. A simple sentence will suffice rather than just words or phrases. Thank you.</b></p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>See sample below. Thank you.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"shots\">\n        <figure><a href=\"/ft/day1/img/monitoring-sheet-sample-1.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day1/img/monitoring-sheet-sample-1.png\" alt=\"Sample monitoring sheet\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure>\n        <figure><a href=\"/ft/day1/img/monitoring-sheet-sample-2.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day1/img/monitoring-sheet-sample-2.png\" alt=\"Sample monitoring sheet\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure>\n      </div>"},{"id":"homework","h":"HOMEWORK: Nitro Pro and Adobe Acrobat Pro","html":"<p>📌To be accomplished outside training hours. 📌</p>\n<p>Please watch the instructional videos on how to navigate either Nitro Pro and Adobe Acrobat Pro, depending on the software you are using.</p>\n<p>If you are using Nitro Pro, watch the Nitro Pro tutorials.<br>If you are using Adobe Acrobat Pro, watch the Adobe Acrobat Pro tutorials.<br>Focus on the version relevant to your available tool. Thank you.</p>\n<p><b>HOW TO USE NITRO PRO</b></p>\n<p class=\"url-list\">\n  <span>PART 1: <a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"HOW TO USE NITRO PRO — PART 1\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1t1xyjsqum9HRv6c4TZDGmGct297WyAwb/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1t1xyjsqum9HRv6c4TZDGmGct297WyAwb/view?usp=sharing</a></span>\n  <span>PART 2: <a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"HOW TO USE NITRO PRO — PART 2\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Y6TYfqzZ5kFHdvcxxi1XS2XgVwnXOdFd/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Y6TYfqzZ5kFHdvcxxi1XS2XgVwnXOdFd/view?usp=sharing</a></span>\n</p>\n<p><b>ADOBE ACROBAT PRO TUTORIAL</b></p>\n<p class=\"url-list\"><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"ADOBE ACROBAT PRO TUTORIAL\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DpbcYj7TtJkU7WhIdmety7Xqi3kegHl3/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DpbcYj7TtJkU7WhIdmety7Xqi3kegHl3/view?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<p>*** Free Communication Upskill for 1 or 1 ½ hours</p>"},{"id":"to-be-added","h":"To be added","placeholder":true,"html":"<div class=\"ftdd-ph ftdd-ph-blank\"><span class=\"ftdd-ph-ic\">📌</span><div><b>More for Day 1 is on its way</b><p>Your trainer will add the rest of today’s material here. Until then, follow the slides before this one and the training GC.</p></div></div>"}]},"2":{"day":2,"title":"VA Essentials","heading":"DAY 2 VA Essentials","slides":[{"id":"s1","h":"AM: Buffer Time (1–2 hrs)","html":"<p>Carryover period for completing any pending Day 1 tasks.</p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">2.</span><span><b>AM:</b><b><i> Common Terms Used &amp; Auto Liability Insurance</i></b></span></p>\n<p>Kindly proceed right away to your first set of tasks in today&#x27;s training session. Thank you.                                      </p>"},{"id":"s2","h":"Topics: Common Terms Used & Auto Liability Insurance","html":"<p>Task 1 - Please go to this link to watch the video presentation on Common Terms Used</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Task 1 - Please go to this link to watch the video presentation on Common Terms Used https\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1eErVAp_HkPPCnpQNJ63S3icIWMCbHi_D/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1eErVAp_HkPPCnpQNJ63S3icIWMCbHi_D/view?usp=sharing</a> </p>\n<p>You may also go to this link for reference: </p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Common Terms Used &amp; Auto Liability Insurance\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1tmV26rq_1z1mpq1C5hUweLytfyJUtkai/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;amp;amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;amp;amp;rtpof=true&amp;amp;amp;sd=true\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1tmV26rq_1z1mpq1C5hUweLytfyJUtkai/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true</a></p>\n<p>Task 2 - Watch this video presentation about how auto liability insurance works, the importance of knowing the policy limit and the different insurance coverages that we can possibly open claims for. </p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Task 2 - Watch this video presentation about how auto liability insurance works, the impor\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1K9AXO0XZJjGFXHPugLAbjeVgcC3fIZuE/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1K9AXO0XZJjGFXHPugLAbjeVgcC3fIZuE/view?usp=sharing</a> </p>\n<p>Task 3 - Update items #5 -7 in your monitoring sheet.</p>\n<p><b>Note:</b> As soon as you are done watching the videos, please type done here in our GC.  Thank you.</p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"2:s2-1\"></div>\n<p>      📌</p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">1.</span><span><b>AS YOUR HOMEWORK</b>, which is intended to evaluate your understanding of the common terms frequently used during training and actual tasks, as well as your basic grasp of key auto insurance concepts relevant to future topics like claim creation and coverage review — kindly accomplish the following:</span></p>\n<p>Common Terms Used – Assessment</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"AS YOUR HOMEWORK\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/14sz5f3HTQKmryc7Upvlc6qua008rPnmw/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;amp;amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;amp;amp;rtpof=true&amp;amp;amp;sd=true\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/14sz5f3HTQKmryc7Upvlc6qua008rPnmw/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true</a></p>\n<p>Auto Liability Insurance – Assessment</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"AS YOUR HOMEWORK\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/11K7q6M8-mbtOU9OYA6wGe-vAKU6HKq6C/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;amp;amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;amp;amp;rtpof=true&amp;amp;amp;sd=true\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/11K7q6M8-mbtOU9OYA6wGe-vAKU6HKq6C/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true</a></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">2.</span><span>Please upload your completed assessments in the Assessments/Activities subfolder inside your training folder.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">3.</span><span>Checking and feedback (including item clarifications and enrichment) will be done tomorrow. 📌</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">4.</span><span>While waiting for your teammates to complete their tasks, please read through the articles below on Personal Injury. Thanks.    </span></p>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"2:s2-2\"></div>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ZOVrwOTPEz9WuwDRbBsBCNuHqf8wb8h4/view?usp=sharing\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ZOVrwOTPEz9WuwDRbBsBCNuHqf8wb8h4/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ZOVrwOTPEz9WuwDRbBsBCNuHqf8wb8h4/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ni4Yg-dublrci2drQhlMVaqxo53xtfP1/view?usp=sharing\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ni4Yg-dublrci2drQhlMVaqxo53xtfP1/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ni4Yg-dublrci2drQhlMVaqxo53xtfP1/view?usp=sharing</a></p>"},{"id":"s3","h":"AM: Classroom Discussion on Law Firm Communication","html":"<div class=\"canva-frame\" id=\"lawFirmCommFrame\">\n  <iframe\n    loading=\"lazy\"\n    title=\"Law Firm Communication (Canva)\"\n    src=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGtUzUSX0A/o4fGwijKtWkkQ7fQR-oI9Q/view?embed\"\n    allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"\n    allow=\"fullscreen\">\n  </iframe>\n</div>\n<div class=\"actions\">\n  <span></span>\n  <div class=\"btn-row\">\n    <button class=\"btn ghost\" type=\"button\" data-fullscreen=\"lawFirmCommFrame\">⛶ Full screen</button>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGtUzUSX0A/o4fGwijKtWkkQ7fQR-oI9Q/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open in Canva ↗</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"2:s3-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"ftdd-pq\">✍️ <b>Today’s Process Questions</b> are answered in <a class=\"ftdd-link\" onclick=\"goto('process')\">✍️ Knowledge Check</a>, after the day’s activities — not here.</div>\n<p><b>Escalation Handling Exercise</b></p>\n<div class=\"canva-frame\" id=\"cvDAGuqWaTQDM\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Canva\" src=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGuqWaTQDM/4WhISjBbgtrQoPfgGYoOyQ/view?embed\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" allow=\"fullscreen\"></iframe></div><div class=\"actions\"><span></span><div class=\"btn-row\"><button class=\"btn ghost\" type=\"button\" data-fullscreen=\"cvDAGuqWaTQDM\">⛶ Full screen</button><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGuqWaTQDM/4WhISjBbgtrQoPfgGYoOyQ/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open in Canva ↗</a></div></div>"},{"id":"s4","h":"HOMEWORK: Softphones and PPTs on Documents & Spreadsheets, Keyboard Shortcuts, and Shadowing Etiquette","html":"<p>📌To be accomplished outside training hours. 📌</p>\n<p><b>Topic: Softphones</b></p>\n<p>Task 1 – Please follow this link to view the instructional video on Softphones. Watch ONE SAMPLE type only from the video for your takeaways on your monitoring sheet. You can continue watching it during your idle time. The purpose of this video is to provide a reference in case you learn in the future which specific softphone your client will use. You can then revisit this video for your reference. </p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Task 1 – Please follow this link to view the instructional video on Softphones. Watch ONE \" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/15aa9GSp3DtOFCG2nQD4CgDPsljA1usQ2/view\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/15aa9GSp3DtOFCG2nQD4CgDPsljA1usQ2/view</a> </p>\n<p><b>Topic: Documents &amp; Spreadsheets, Keyboard Shortcuts, and Shadowing Etiquette</b></p>\n<p>Task 2 – Please review the following PPT materials and pay close attention to the information presented in each slide.</p>\n<p>2026 VERSION</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"2026 VERSION https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-uB07Lu7nPeRpdDwOzvAKFMjZbXKQW-r?usp=\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-uB07Lu7nPeRpdDwOzvAKFMjZbXKQW-r?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-uB07Lu7nPeRpdDwOzvAKFMjZbXKQW-r?usp=sharing</a> </p>\n<p>OLD VERSION</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"OLD VERSION https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1sR8tjpMXPGWJo9cldpNWFdPhtMgq4n-y\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1sR8tjpMXPGWJo9cldpNWFdPhtMgq4n-y\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1sR8tjpMXPGWJo9cldpNWFdPhtMgq4n-y</a> </p>\n<p>Task 3 - Update items #8-9 in your monitoring sheet.</p>\n<p><b><i>*** Free Communication Upskill for 1 or 1 ½ hours</i></b></p>"},{"id":"to-be-added","h":"To be added","placeholder":true,"html":"<div class=\"ftdd-ph ftdd-ph-blank\"><span class=\"ftdd-ph-ic\">📌</span><div><b>More for Day 2 is on its way</b><p>Your trainer will add the rest of today’s material here. Until then, follow the slides before this one and the training GC.</p></div></div>"}]},"3":{"day":3,"title":"Reception Training","heading":"DAY 3 Reception Training","slides":[{"id":"s1","h":"AM: Checking of Assignments and Classroom Discussion on PI Workflow, Reception Training, and Call Listening on 10 Sample Recordings","html":"<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"3:s1-1\"></div>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"3:s1-2\"></div>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"3:s1-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"ftdd-pq\">✍️ <b>Today’s Process Questions</b> are answered in <a class=\"ftdd-link\" onclick=\"goto('process')\">✍️ Knowledge Check</a>, after the day’s activities — not here.</div>\n<p><b>Confidentiality &amp; Call Response Exercise</b></p>\n<div class=\"canva-frame\" id=\"cvDAGu11x9AEk\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Canva\" src=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGu11x9AEk/W8BIWHVh_g3lH_wLODdEKw/view?embed\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" allow=\"fullscreen\"></iframe></div><div class=\"actions\"><span></span><div class=\"btn-row\"><button class=\"btn ghost\" type=\"button\" data-fullscreen=\"cvDAGu11x9AEk\">⛶ Full screen</button><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGu11x9AEk/W8BIWHVh_g3lH_wLODdEKw/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open in Canva ↗</a></div></div>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"3:s1-4\"></div>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">1.</span><span>Sample Call Recordings</span></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Sample Call Recordings https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1l8_cBDRXnt-h8QvDZJWaZMO194D\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1l8_cBDRXnt-h8QvDZJWaZMO194DWtdSU?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1l8_cBDRXnt-h8QvDZJWaZMO194DWtdSU?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">2.</span><span>Sample SOP</span></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Confidentiality &amp; Call Response Exercise\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1zgK-4uKhdJkUvfOkb9A1Jp73C2wu_UOm/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;amp;amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;amp;amp;rtpof=true&amp;amp;amp;sd=true\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1zgK-4uKhdJkUvfOkb9A1Jp73C2wu_UOm/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true</a></p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day3/img/image12.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day3/img/image12.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day3/img/image17.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day3/img/image17.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">3.</span><span>Reception Activity on VA OSCAR’s recordings</span></p>\n<p>Please Refer to the provided recordings and complete the assessment activity by extracting the data specified in your assessment sheet. Ensure you extract a total of 5 data points from Oscar’s&#x27; recordings. Upload the completed assessment document to your respective trainee folder and work directly from there to finalize it. Thank you.</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Please Refer to the provided recordings and complete the assessment activity by extracting\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hRO-cnY1nabG8btm1U9OnZxvqYmiwLyn?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hRO-cnY1nabG8btm1U9OnZxvqYmiwLyn?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day3/img/image14.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day3/img/image14.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"3:s1-5\"></div>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"DAY 3 Reception Training\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1qCEqeoGJTf-0OvmP_cdxYJWmqlBU06aU/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;amp;amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;amp;amp;rtpof=true&amp;amp;amp;sd=true\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1qCEqeoGJTf-0OvmP_cdxYJWmqlBU06aU/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true</a></p>\n<p>4. Carlos &amp; remaining Oscar’s’ Reception Recordings are supplementary materials only and are not included in training hours. Trainees may review them during idle or personal time for additional learning.</p>\n<p>In addition, here are additional reception call recordings of VAs Carlos &amp; Oscar for your future reference. Thank you. </p>\n<p>Carlos’ Reception Recordings</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Carlos’ Reception Recordings https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1bP8yBy9WhPgUOnfh-IAvW\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1bP8yBy9WhPgUOnfh-IAvWI4V6UVeYyeI\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1bP8yBy9WhPgUOnfh-IAvWI4V6UVeYyeI</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Carlos’ Reception Recordings https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1S3L8ecBadvrN_AmGpeQD9\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1S3L8ecBadvrN_AmGpeQD98mY1148Rvof\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1S3L8ecBadvrN_AmGpeQD98mY1148Rvof</a></p>\n<p>Oscar’s Reception Recordings</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Oscar’s Reception Recordings https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ZGr22vm6RW4avTBCn8tCf\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ZGr22vm6RW4avTBCn8tCfGexkZMfsavX?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ZGr22vm6RW4avTBCn8tCfGexkZMfsavX?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">"},{"id":"s2","h":"FOR YOUR HOMEWORK","html":"<p>Please watch the CRM/CMS training videos and then update item #12 in your Monitoring Sheet. Thank you.</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Please watch the CRM/CMS training videos and then update item #12 in your Monitoring Sheet\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1dIR3Hl7ybLnUtOk9ycyCbpXGnjR3FzMs/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1dIR3Hl7ybLnUtOk9ycyCbpXGnjR3FzMs/view?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Please watch the CRM/CMS training videos and then update item #12 in your Monitoring Sheet\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/12HcMi38KO4898qd262UF_z_gB-IzHn0c/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/12HcMi38KO4898qd262UF_z_gB-IzHn0c/view?usp=drive_link</a>, </p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Please watch the CRM/CMS training videos and then update item #12 in your Monitoring Sheet\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pa7Smlp9ePfOEq9YNjWfW6mmaJaeRyDo/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pa7Smlp9ePfOEq9YNjWfW6mmaJaeRyDo/view?usp=drive_link</a>, </p>\n<p> <a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Please watch the CRM/CMS training videos and then update item #12 in your Monitoring Sheet\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1IiZJ8yq4fo1dQfM8q-2vd3hxxLAn8659/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1IiZJ8yq4fo1dQfM8q-2vd3hxxLAn8659/view?usp=drive_link</a>, </p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Please watch the CRM/CMS training videos and then update item #12 in your Monitoring Sheet\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1HppO3mZWuROS1XZijVmGiX_yDDFhtHgk/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1HppO3mZWuROS1XZijVmGiX_yDDFhtHgk/view?usp=drive_link</a> </p>\n<p><b><i>*** Free Communication Upskill for 1 or 1 ½ hours</i></b></p>"},{"id":"to-be-added","h":"To be added","placeholder":true,"html":"<div class=\"ftdd-ph ftdd-ph-blank\"><span class=\"ftdd-ph-ic\">📌</span><div><b>More for Day 3 is on its way</b><p>Your trainer will add the rest of today’s material here. Until then, follow the slides before this one and the training GC.</p></div></div>"}]},"4":{"day":4,"title":"Reception Training","heading":"DAY 4 Reception Training","slides":[{"id":"s1","h":"AM: Training Video Viewing and Mock Call Preparation","html":"<p>For those who have already completed the tasks, please watch these videos on Reception Training to understand the roles and responsibilities of a Receptionist, as well as the necessary attributes required for the role.</p>"},{"id":"s2","h":"Topic: Handling Reception Tasks","html":"<p>Task 1 - Watch this training video with one of our virtual receptionists. Here you would see the VA demonstrating how to handle all sorts of calls and general receptionist tasks. </p>\n<p>RECEPTION TRAINING WITH JULIO [1:49:49]</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"RECEPTION TRAINING WITH JULIO [1:49:49] https://drive.google.com/file/d/1G5o0O1fTWjUzxrxIB\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1G5o0O1fTWjUzxrxIBH1ikbbmh4ywFt5C/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1G5o0O1fTWjUzxrxIBH1ikbbmh4ywFt5C/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p>Task 2 - Update items #10 &amp; 11 in your monitoring sheet.</p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"4:s2-1\"></div>"},{"id":"s3","h":"PM: Reception Mock Calls","html":"<p><b>Reception Mock Calls Metrics</b></p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day4/img/image7.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day4/img/image7.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<p><b><i>*** Free Communication Upskill for 1 or 1 ½ hours</i></b></p>"},{"id":"to-be-added","h":"To be added","placeholder":true,"html":"<div class=\"ftdd-ph ftdd-ph-blank\"><span class=\"ftdd-ph-ic\">📌</span><div><b>More for Day 4 is on its way</b><p>Your trainer will add the rest of today’s material here. Until then, follow the slides before this one and the training GC.</p></div></div>"}]},"5":{"day":5,"title":"Reception Training","heading":"DAY 5 Reception Training","slides":[{"id":"s1","h":"AM: Buffer Time (1–2 hrs) for Reception Mock Calls","html":"<p>Carryover period for completing any pending Day 4 tasks. </p>"},{"id":"s2","h":"AM: Classroom Discussion on Appointment Setting and Calendar Management Training","html":"<div class=\"canva-frame\" id=\"calendarMgmtFrame\">\n  <iframe\n    loading=\"lazy\"\n    title=\"Calendar Management Training (Canva)\"\n    src=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGW71bRci4/W8QMwl3Ui1QXIejya5aHUQ/view?embed\"\n    allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"\n    allow=\"fullscreen\">\n  </iframe>\n</div>\n<div class=\"actions\">\n  <span></span>\n  <div class=\"btn-row\">\n    <button class=\"btn ghost\" type=\"button\" data-fullscreen=\"calendarMgmtFrame\">⛶ Full screen</button>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGW71bRci4/W8QMwl3Ui1QXIejya5aHUQ/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open in Canva ↗</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"5:s2-1\"></div>"},{"id":"s3","h":"Attorney Calendar Management Activity","html":"<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"5:s3-1\"></div>\n<p>Please answer the Attorney Calendar Management Activity. Make sure to follow the instructions carefully, and don’t forget to signify done here as soon as you finish. Thanks.</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Please answer the Attorney Calendar Management Activity. Make sure to follow the instructi\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1VNgbFDn3PgkPwkE6g0PwXYxo-7DmU3MP/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1VNgbFDn3PgkPwkE6g0PwXYxo-7DmU3MP/view?usp=sharing</a> </p>\n<p>Samples</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Samples https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lLquhtY5XQd85X5IEXJcRCkpV39UA8wW?usp=shari\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lLquhtY5XQd85X5IEXJcRCkpV39UA8wW?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lLquhtY5XQd85X5IEXJcRCkpV39UA8wW?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"5:s3-2\"></div>\n<p>REMINDER! Set the appropriate time zone for each activity item. BEFORE saving each appointment, make sure to take a screenshot to capture the correct time zone, as shown in the sample below.</p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day5/img/image28.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day5/img/image28.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<p>When taking a screenshot of the entire calendar, untick the LSH calendar (the one in the orange box), then take a screenshot. Just re-enable it afterward.</p>\n<p>You should have a total of 19 screenshots uploaded to your subfolder in the exact sequence shown in the sample screenshot. Thank you.</p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day5/img/image40.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day5/img/image40.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<p><b><i>*** Free Communication Upskill for 1 or 1 ½ hours</i></b></p>"},{"id":"to-be-added","h":"To be added","placeholder":true,"html":"<div class=\"ftdd-ph ftdd-ph-blank\"><span class=\"ftdd-ph-ic\">📌</span><div><b>More for Day 5 is on its way</b><p>Your trainer will add the rest of today’s material here. Until then, follow the slides before this one and the training GC.</p></div></div>"}]},"6":{"day":6,"title":"Calendar Management Training","heading":"DAY 6 Calendar Management Training","slides":[{"id":"s1","h":"Entire Day: Calendar Management Mock Calls and Training Video Viewing","html":"<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"6:s1-1\"></div>\n<p>While waiting for your turn to perform, kindly watch the following training videos. Thank you.</p>\n<p><b>Part 1  </b></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Part 1 https://drive.google.com/file/d/16zrBv2IsafvW0CphoJHf41JgvZZxcGa5/view?usp=sharing\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/16zrBv2IsafvW0CphoJHf41JgvZZxcGa5/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/16zrBv2IsafvW0CphoJHf41JgvZZxcGa5/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p><b>Part 2  </b></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Part 2 https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jzhsqPS3pFS_PWK-c9m63wVs--OjtY7o/view?usp=sharing\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jzhsqPS3pFS_PWK-c9m63wVs--OjtY7o/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jzhsqPS3pFS_PWK-c9m63wVs--OjtY7o/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p><b>Calendaring 101 </b></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Calendaring 101 https://drive.google.com/file/d/1X9l-70zK3G4JjL_JSBTfHiDVcwzjOUmX/view?usp\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1X9l-70zK3G4JjL_JSBTfHiDVcwzjOUmX/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1X9l-70zK3G4JjL_JSBTfHiDVcwzjOUmX/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p>Refer to these video links as well for your additional reference. </p>\n<p><b>Scheduling Appointment and Calendar Management </b></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Scheduling Appointment and Calendar Management\" href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/f35c3a3f805a4833800c893c4c332dbb?sid=f178c63d-eedf-4d2f-8a2e-564ab3eecb8a\">https://www.loom.com/share/f35c3a3f805a4833800c893c4c332dbb?sid=f178c63d-eedf-4d2f-8a2e-564ab3eecb8a</a></p>\n<p><b>Resource for Scheduling Appointment and Calendar Management </b></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Resource for Scheduling Appointment and Calendar Management\" href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/1e0b0a35cddb41f1b071a99364e3ea88?sid=7ae551c1-23fd-40ca-ac43-eafbb6af9d47\">https://www.loom.com/share/1e0b0a35cddb41f1b071a99364e3ea88?sid=7ae551c1-23fd-40ca-ac43-eafbb6af9d47</a></p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p>@everyone </p>\n<p>Reminders:</p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>No need to submit a separate screenshot for your time zone. Just make sure the time zone is visible in the screenshot for each individual appointment upload.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Please follow the proper screenshot numbering shown in the sample so your files remain organized and in sequence within your subfolder.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Make sure to be specific with your event titles. </span></p>\n<p><b>For example: Client Consultation Meeting – [Client Name]</b></p>\n<p>Please see the sample below for your reference. Please be guided. Thank you.</p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day6/img/image33.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day6/img/image33.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p><b>Calendar Management Mock Calls Metrics</b></p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day6/img/image39.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day6/img/image39.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>"},{"id":"s2","h":"Additional Activity: Calendar Management – Mock Call Scenarios","html":"<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"6:s2-1\"></div>\n<h4>Please take note of the following guidelines:</h4>\n<h4>Minimum Information to Collect from Caller</h4>\n<h4>VA must obtain:</h4>\n<h4><span class=\"lbl-h\">•</span>Name</h4>\n<h4><span class=\"lbl-h\">•</span>Callback Number</h4>\n<h4><span class=\"lbl-h\">•</span>Date of Birth (DOB)</h4>\n<h4><span class=\"lbl-h\">•</span>Date of Loss (DOL)</h4>\n<h4>📌 Possible Scenarios / Nature of Request (to be calendared)</h4>\n<h4>Client Consultation: New PI Case – (Client Name) Notes: New PI case; (instructions provided by client)</h4>\n<h4>Document Review Follow-Up – (Client Name) Notes: Review contract documents; Zoom meeting; (observations and instructions)</h4>\n<h4>Case Strategy Meeting – (Client Name) Notes: Litigation planning; (observations and instructions)</h4>\n<h4>New Intake Consultation – (Client Name) Notes: New intake consultation</h4>\n<h4>Deposition Preparation – (Client Name) Notes: Preparation for deposition</h4>\n<h4>Medical Records Review – (Client Name) Notes: Review new PT notes</h4>\n<h4>Attorney Phone Consultation – (Client Name) Notes: Clarification regarding demand</h4>\n<h4>Document Signing – (Client Name) Notes: Settlement documents; in-office meeting</h4>\n<h4>Case Review Consultation – (Client Name) Notes: Possible wrongful termination</h4>\n<h4>Post-Settlement Meeting – (Client Name) Notes: Ensure full breakdown is available</h4>\n<h4>Discovery Conference – (Client Name) Notes: Review interrogatories &amp; RFPs</h4>\n<h4>Follow-Up Call (Existing Client) – (Client Name) Notes: Existing PI client; follow-up on insurance update</h4>\n<h4>Missed Call Consultation – (Client Name) Notes: Contract dispute</h4>\n<h4>Case Status Update – (Client Name) Notes: Insurance update ready for review</h4>\n<h4>Urgent Meeting Request – (Client Name) Notes: Urgent litigation update</h4>\n<h4>Mediation Preparation Call – (Client Name) Notes: Review mediation materials</h4>\n<h4>✅ Scheduling Rules</h4>\n<h4><span class=\"lbl-h\">•</span>Identify available slots only</h4>\n<h4><span class=\"lbl-h\">•</span>Avoid lunch, buffer time, and blocked events</h4>\n<h4><span class=\"lbl-h\">•</span>Offer 2–3 alternative times when a requested slot is unavailable </h4>\n<h4><span class=\"lbl-h\">•</span>Clarify meeting type (phone, video, or in-person)</h4>\n<h4><span class=\"lbl-h\">•</span>Plot the appointment in the attorney’s calendar. </h4>\n<h4><span class=\"lbl-h\">•</span>Calendar should be in EST time zone.</h4>\n<h4><span class=\"lbl-h\">•</span>Set an email reminder a day before the event.</h4>\n<h4>📌 Additional Notes </h4>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>The attorney does not take new client consults after 5:00 PM.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>New client consults are only scheduled on Tuesdays and Thursdays</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>The attorney accepts max 3 new client consults per day.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Phone consults, status updates, follow up calls, review, regular and urgent meetings, and signing meetings are max 30 minutes.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Follow-ups are not scheduled during mornings.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>All consultation meetings are phone consults only.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Phone consults only between 9:30 AM – 3:00 PM; Attorney will call the client - VA must confirm callback number.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span> Preparation, strategy, and settlement meetings are max 45 minutes.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Conference meetings are max 1 hour.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span> Attorney requires 15-minute buffer before and after every meeting</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Same-day bookings require attorney approval</span></p>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"6:s2-2\"></div>\n<p><b><i>*** Free Communication Upskill for 1 or 1 ½ hours</i></b></p>"},{"id":"to-be-added","h":"To be added","placeholder":true,"html":"<div class=\"ftdd-ph ftdd-ph-blank\"><span class=\"ftdd-ph-ic\">📌</span><div><b>More for Day 6 is on its way</b><p>Your trainer will add the rest of today’s material here. Until then, follow the slides before this one and the training GC.</p></div></div>"}]},"7":{"day":7,"title":"Intake Training","heading":"DAY 7: Intake Training","slides":[{"id":"s1","h":"AM: Classroom Discussion on Intake Specialist Training and Call Listening","html":"<div class=\"canva-frame\" id=\"intakeRoleFrame\">\n  <iframe\n    loading=\"lazy\"\n    title=\"The Intake Specialist Role (Canva)\"\n    src=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGtVEq2L8E/FeCRMu4p2OHrj7LYPz6rRA/view?embed\"\n    allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"\n    allow=\"fullscreen\">\n  </iframe>\n</div>\n<div class=\"actions\">\n  <span></span>\n  <div class=\"btn-row\">\n    <button class=\"btn ghost\" type=\"button\" data-fullscreen=\"intakeRoleFrame\">⛶ Full screen</button>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGtVEq2L8E/FeCRMu4p2OHrj7LYPz6rRA/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open in Canva ↗</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"7:s1-1\"></div>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"7:s1-2\"></div>\n<div class=\"ftdd-pq\">✍️ <b>Today’s Process Questions</b> are answered in <a class=\"ftdd-link\" onclick=\"goto('process')\">✍️ Knowledge Check</a>, after the day’s activities — not here.</div>\n<p><b>Intake Scenario Exercise</b></p>\n<div class=\"canva-frame\" id=\"cvDAGvIBQND5M\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Canva\" src=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGvIBQND5M/TSvwREepwfjf9RJnl5DDYQ/view?embed\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" allow=\"fullscreen\"></iframe></div><div class=\"actions\"><span></span><div class=\"btn-row\"><button class=\"btn ghost\" type=\"button\" data-fullscreen=\"cvDAGvIBQND5M\">⛶ Full screen</button><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGvIBQND5M/TSvwREepwfjf9RJnl5DDYQ/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open in Canva ↗</a></div></div>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"7:s1-3\"></div>\n<p><b>Insurance Providers:</b></p>\n<p>UAIG</p>\n<p>State Farm</p>\n<p>Progressive</p>\n<p>Allstate</p>\n<p>Liberty Mutual</p>\n<p>Geico</p>\n<p>Travelers</p>\n<p>USAA</p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day7/img/image38.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day7/img/image38.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/ft/day7/img/image36.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day7/img/image36.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<p>Accident or Injury Claim Accident and Evidence Checklist</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Accident or Injury Claim Accident and Evidence Checklist https://drive.google.com/file/d/1\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-a8jF7dTZxdoYv4brVSe9GwGrT9MGFnV/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-a8jF7dTZxdoYv4brVSe9GwGrT9MGFnV/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p>Fillable Intake Forms [Dog Bite, Medical Malpractice, Premise Liability, Slip &amp; Fall, MVC/MVA]</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Fillable Intake Forms [Dog Bite, Medical Malpractice, Premise Liability, Slip &amp; Fall, MVC/\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1sdpjU_vYPuuvP1U07uHuHYiBcy2uG3kF/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1sdpjU_vYPuuvP1U07uHuHYiBcy2uG3kF/view?usp=sharing</a> </p>\n<p>Mock Intake (non-VLF) recording</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Mock Intake (non-VLF) recording https://drive.google.com/file/d/1VMNX0CrUXBtGAf0xkDq8r6sr4\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1VMNX0CrUXBtGAf0xkDq8r6sr4NRNDW4S/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1VMNX0CrUXBtGAf0xkDq8r6sr4NRNDW4S/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day7/img/image37.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day7/img/image37.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<p>Sample Intake Audio Recordings</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Sample Intake Audio Recordings https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16o9xsbY9dRIl8-fSBN2\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16o9xsbY9dRIl8-fSBN2B3fNWuEXmo52q?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16o9xsbY9dRIl8-fSBN2B3fNWuEXmo52q?usp=sharing</a> </p>\n<p>Other Intake-Related Documents</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Other Intake-Related Documents https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UrLBiX0ntxzvyxvRkHB\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UrLBiX0ntxzvyxvRkHBhdTevtoP2jLzX?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UrLBiX0ntxzvyxvRkHBhdTevtoP2jLzX?usp=sharing</a></p>"},{"id":"s2","h":"PM: Scheduled Shadowing (Shadow Buddy or Intake Videos, if unavailable)","html":"<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"7:s2-1\"></div>\n<p><b>Example: </b></p>\n<p>Shadowing Intake Specialist Role/ Insurance Communication Role/ Provider Communication Role/ Lien Negotiator Role (Arlene/ Edward/ Vince/ Allesa/ Mario)</p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p><b>@everyone</b> Kindly update this section of your TAM after the session. Thanks.</p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day7/img/image29.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day7/img/image29.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day7/img/image42.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day7/img/image42.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p>Please proceed to watch these intake shadowing videos of Maria Mangaoang. Thank you.   </p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Please proceed to watch these intake shadowing videos of Maria Mangaoang. Thank you. https\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SC653puBU7dh4tYjQjXcr8KZ4yhYxsLV/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SC653puBU7dh4tYjQjXcr8KZ4yhYxsLV/view?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Please proceed to watch these intake shadowing videos of Maria Mangaoang. Thank you. https\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/16DavSPhSUGF88UnltYxl932dsZsYkQtY/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/16DavSPhSUGF88UnltYxl932dsZsYkQtY/view?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Please proceed to watch these intake shadowing videos of Maria Mangaoang. Thank you. https\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_dsswdnznMTWJAykRJkJKMCOoGg-c8pw/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_dsswdnznMTWJAykRJkJKMCOoGg-c8pw/view?usp=drive_link</a>.</p>\n<p><b><i>***Free Communication Upskill for 1 or 1 ½ hours</i></b></p>"},{"id":"to-be-added","h":"To be added","placeholder":true,"html":"<div class=\"ftdd-ph ftdd-ph-blank\"><span class=\"ftdd-ph-ic\">📌</span><div><b>More for Day 7 is on its way</b><p>Your trainer will add the rest of today’s material here. Until then, follow the slides before this one and the training GC.</p></div></div>"}]},"8":{"day":8,"title":"Intake Training","heading":"DAY 8: Intake Training","slides":[{"id":"s1","h":"AM: Intake Process, Intake Overview, and Intake Documents","html":"<p>After completing your spelling &amp; typing tests, kindly proceed right away to work on these sets of tasks for today’s training session.  Thank you.</p>\n<p><b>Topic 1: Intake Process</b></p>\n<p>Task 1 - Please watch these two videos:</p>\n<p>A. Intake Process Overview  </p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"A. Intake Process Overview https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wBga2HLLRAzdD_t5s8zgmRVqcKq23T\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wBga2HLLRAzdD_t5s8zgmRVqcKq23TES/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wBga2HLLRAzdD_t5s8zgmRVqcKq23TES/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p>B. Saving intake documents and updating fields in the Intake Tab</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"B. Saving intake documents and updating fields in the Intake Tab https://drive.google.com/\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1n4cmYMsoKRBm8FxMaeac7-TZkwegVvVW/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1n4cmYMsoKRBm8FxMaeac7-TZkwegVvVW/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p>Task 2 - Update #15 (Intake Process) in your monitoring   </p>\n<p><b>-----------------</b></p>\n<p>Topic 2: Intake Calling (MVC) </p>\n<p>Task 1 - Watch this training video with Atty. Sandy Van on how to handle Intake Calls for MVC cases. </p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Task 1 - Watch this training video with Atty. Sandy Van on how to handle Intake Calls for \" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KGd9N0hCGdiY79O1uqB6GOe1d4GAayOh/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KGd9N0hCGdiY79O1uqB6GOe1d4GAayOh/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p>Task 2 - Update item #14 in your monitoring sheet.</p>\n<p><b>-----------------</b></p>\n<p><b>Topic 2: Intake Documents (MVA Cases)</b></p>\n<p>Task 1-  Watch this video presentation about the Intake Packet and the Intake Documents.</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Task 1- Watch this video presentation about the Intake Packet and the Intake Documents. ht\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pa2Ezfvxc9bxRP9xq6z3WCWFjlAOJbIz/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pa2Ezfvxc9bxRP9xq6z3WCWFjlAOJbIz/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p>Task 2 - Extract each document from the Intake Packet and rename it properly using the standard naming convention. </p>\n<p>Task 3 - Answer the worksheet for intake documents.</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Topic 2: Intake Documents (MVA Cases)\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1O1Oxh2vmK7OPFaJjGyjjofZwNZG5vDqJ/edit?usp=sharing&amp;amp;amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;amp;amp;rtpof=true&amp;amp;amp;sd=true\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1O1Oxh2vmK7OPFaJjGyjjofZwNZG5vDqJ/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true</a> </p>\n<p>Task 4 - Update #16 (Intake Documents) in your monitoring sheet. </p>\n<p>NOTE:</p>\n<p>Please create a subfolder under your Assessments/Activities folder and name it after your assigned client. Upload all the extracted intake documents ALONG with the renamed assigned Intake Packet using this naming convention: <b>INTAKE - Packet (VA&#x27;s Name)</b>.  For your completed Intake Worksheet, upload it directly into your Assessments/Activities folder -- NOT inside the subfolder you created for the extracted intake documents.</p>\n<p>Thank you!</p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"8:s1-1\"></div>\n<p>Redacted Intake Packets</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Redacted Intake Packets https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JbAieyhJ6XVsRvNXMUUtVfRwY_\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JbAieyhJ6XVsRvNXMUUtVfRwY_0KNymT?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JbAieyhJ6XVsRvNXMUUtVfRwY_0KNymT?usp=sharing</a> </p>\n<p>Answer Sheets</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Answer Sheets https://drive.google.com/file/d/1er1uyBoPJGlp2ijBdKn_n_CReu1rzyQz/view?usp=s\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1er1uyBoPJGlp2ijBdKn_n_CReu1rzyQz/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1er1uyBoPJGlp2ijBdKn_n_CReu1rzyQz/view?usp=sharing</a> </p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Answer Sheets https://drive.google.com/file/d/13-XjW0CP9vuj1itHrfE0gSsRpQ4fuzUB/view?usp=s\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/13-XjW0CP9vuj1itHrfE0gSsRpQ4fuzUB/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/13-XjW0CP9vuj1itHrfE0gSsRpQ4fuzUB/view?usp=sharing</a> </p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<h4>Additional Instruction:</h4>\n<p>Please don&#x27;t forget to rename each extracted document using our document-naming convention. You may refer to this Tettra article,  </p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Please don&#x27;t forget to rename each extracted document using our document-naming convention\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xn7o6kmz7zUc2h6UAj2qIqytr6QoABzM/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xn7o6kmz7zUc2h6UAj2qIqytr6QoABzM/view?usp=sharing</a> </p>\n<p> OR you may use the most updated naming conventions found in your intake worksheet.</p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"8:s1-2\"></div>\n<p>Kindly check these ADDITIONAL intake documents which are NOT INCLUDED in the training video for your additional reference. Thanks</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Kindly check these ADDITIONAL intake documents which are NOT INCLUDED in the training vide\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fC8iixgMEVV3cDrtU0sFa0N325uVB4mb?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fC8iixgMEVV3cDrtU0sFa0N325uVB4mb?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">1.</span><span>Client Communication Disclosure</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">2.</span><span>Signature Certificate</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">3.</span><span>CM Notes</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">4.</span><span>Police Report</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">5.</span><span>TAR/Traffic Accident Report </span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">6.</span><span>TAR/Traffic Accident Report  with Labels</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">7.</span><span>Traffic Ticket (accomplished)</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">8.</span><span>Traffic Ticket with Labels.1</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">9.</span><span>Traffic Ticket with Labels.2</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">10.</span><span>DMV</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">11.</span><span>ISO Claim Search</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">12.</span><span>Insurance vs Lien Disclaimer (newly added)</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">13.</span><span>Affidavit of Communication (newly added)</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">14.</span><span>Notice and Waiver of Potential Conflict of Interest (latest version of Conflict of Interest Waiver)</span></p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p>For those who have issues with Nitro Pro, you may use any available pdf editor you have that has similar editing features to Nitro, OR you may use this online pdf editor.<a href=\"https://www.ilovepdf.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> </a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ilovepdf.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.ilovepdf.com/</a></p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p><b>To ensure clarity:</b></p>\n<p>• For your Intake Worksheet task, your reference is the video Topic 3: Task 1.</p>\n<p>• For your assigned Intake Packet extraction and renaming, refer to Topic 3: Task 2.</p>\n<p>• As for the new documents not covered in the Task 1 video, please refer to the additional documents I’ve provided for your reference.</p>\n<p>Thanks.</p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"ft-table\"><tr><td><p>@everyone </p><p>To ensure a seamless performance later, refer to the fillable forms and recordings for your mock calls and the tutorial video for your demonstration. Since access to the CMS will only be provided during the demo, then I suggest including visual aids in your guides so that you will not get lost during the demonstration proper.</p><p>As much as we would like to provide access to the CMS ahead of time for practice, the accounts currently available have access to live case files. To prevent any unauthorized access or unintended changes to those cases, we’re unable to provide access in advance.</p><p>We hope for your understanding regarding this limitation. In the meantime, please make the most of the resources currently available to you to familiarize yourself with and learn the process as much as possible. Thanks!</p><div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day8/img/image35.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day8/img/image35.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div><div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day8/img/image72.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day8/img/image72.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div><div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day8/img/image24.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day8/img/image24.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div></td></tr></table></div>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p><b>Added on 10/08/2026 - B092526</b></p>\n<p>Hi @everyone! For this afternoon&#x27;s training activities, please be guided by the following **<b>additional reminders and instructions:</b>**</p>\n<p>**<b>1. Smart Advocate (SA) Demonstration – Saving the Intake Packet and Extracted Documents</b>**</p>\n<p>You will first demonstrate the process of saving the completed Intake Packet and extracted intake documents ***<b><i>in VLF&#x27;s CMS --  SA.</i></b>***</p>\n<p>To prepare, please review the instructional video provided earlier and familiarize yourselves with the steps involved.</p>\n<p>**<b>2. Intake Mock Call Activity – Training Platform (Prototype CMS)</b>**</p>\n<p>After completing your SA demonstration, you will proceed with the Intake Mock Call Activity ***<b><i>using the Training Platform.</i></b>***</p>\n<p>Please review the provided fillable intake forms and call recordings to familiarize yourselves with the required client and incident information and the appropriate intake questions.</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Please review the provided fillable intake forms and call recordings to familiarize yourse\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1sdpjU_vYPuuvP1U07uHuHYiBcy2uG3kF/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1sdpjU_vYPuuvP1U07uHuHYiBcy2uG3kF/view?usp=sharing</a>   </p>\n<p>You may also explore the Prototype CMS within the Training Platform to become familiar with its fields and navigation.</p>\n<p>During the mock call, you are expected to ask appropriate intake questions, gather all necessary client and incident information, and ***<b><i>accurately enter the details obtained directly into the corresponding fields in the Prototype CMS, instead of using the fillable intake forms.</i></b>***</p>\n<p>While waiting for your scheduled turn for the Intake Mock Call Activity, please use your idle time to practice handling intake calls through the Call Simulator.</p>\n<p>Thank you.</p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">"},{"id":"s2","h":"AM: Demo Tutorial Viewing and Demo Preparation","html":"<p><b><i>Instructional Video_How to Save the Intake Packet and Extracted Intake Documents in SA</i></b></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Instructional Video_How to Save the Intake Packet and Extracted Intake Documents in SA htt\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/19nLaPeT0PLq2fBSqtC6S2dVYfUYek3pK/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/19nLaPeT0PLq2fBSqtC6S2dVYfUYek3pK/view?usp=sharing</a> </p>"},{"id":"s3","h":"PM: Uploading Intake Packet and Extracted Intake Documents on SA and Atty. Sandy’s Video","html":"<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Since there are 2 training accounts used in SA (Jane Doe &amp; John Doe/ DOCGEN Dummy Account), ensure that tasks are posted in the SA Tasks Tab for BOTH accounts.</span></p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day8/img/image21.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day8/img/image21.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<p><b>Sample tasks in the DESCRIPTION box:</b></p>\n<p>***** Intake Packet and Intake Documents Saving Tasks: Batch B022026 ***</p>\n<p>03/06/2025 Please save the client&#x27;s Intake Packet and extracted intake documents in the client&#x27;s project.</p>\n<p>Documents to save:</p>\n<p>1. INTAKE PACKET - 1 (Martin)</p>\n<p>2. INTAKE PACKET - 2 (Michelle)</p>\n<p>3. INTAKE PACKET - 3 (Mikee)</p>\n<p>Thank you!</p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Also ensure that all the intake documents have already been extracted from the assigned Intake Packet and all extracted files. including the raw material or assigned Intake Packet have been correctly renamed following the firm’s naming convention. This is a required activity PRIOR to this demo, as these are the exact files that will be uploaded and reported on SA.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Give each trainee 10-15 minutes to quickly explore SA since the system is not capable of simultaneous access or does not allow more than one user to access it at the same time.</span></p>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"8:s3-1\"></div>\n<p><b>Saving Intake Packet and Extracted Intake Documents to SA Demo Metrics</b></p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day8/img/image31.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day8/img/image31.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<p><b><i>***Free Communication Upskill for 1 or 1 ½ hours</i></b></p>"},{"id":"to-be-added","h":"To be added","placeholder":true,"html":"<div class=\"ftdd-ph ftdd-ph-blank\"><span class=\"ftdd-ph-ic\">📌</span><div><b>More for Day 8 is on its way</b><p>Your trainer will add the rest of today’s material here. Until then, follow the slides before this one and the training GC.</p></div></div>"}]},"9":{"day":9,"title":"Intake Training","heading":"DAY 9: Intake Training","slides":[{"id":"s1","h":"AM: Buffer Time (1–2 hrs) for Intake Demo","html":"<p>Carryover period for completing the Intake demo. Any remaining time in the morning session shall be allocated for intake mock call preparation.</p>"},{"id":"s2","h":"AM: Intake Mock Call Preparation","html":"<p>While you wait for your turn, practise intake calls on the Call Simulator — the Intake Line on ☎ LSH Ring Channel. Take as many practice callers as you like: they are not scored, and the line is the same one your graded call rings on.</p><p>Run through the intake questions in order, enter what you gather straight into the Prototype CMS's fields as you go, and close by confirming the callback number and what happens next.</p><p><b>Intake Mock Calls Metrics</b></p><p><b>After the mock calls:</b> a debrief is scheduled once everyone's calls are done — your trainer runs through the scorecard with you, what went well and what to change before the next one.</p>"},{"id":"s3","h":"PM: Transcription Activity & Mock Calls","html":"<h5>3.1. Minutes of the Meeting Transcription Activity: Client-to-Attorney Activity</h5>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"9:s3-1\"></div>\n<p>Transcription - Recording 1 (va’s first name)</p>\n<p>Transcription - Recording 2 (va’s first name)</p>\n<p>Once each transcription is completed, they must save the file in their Assessments/Activities folder.</p>\n<p>Sample Minutes of the Meeting/Transcription:</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Sample Minutes of the Meeting/Transcription: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CAGSbA5_REY8\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CAGSbA5_REY8UqvCAfn2khyDEL4QMR0m/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CAGSbA5_REY8UqvCAfn2khyDEL4QMR0m/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p>Interview Recording 1:</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Interview Recording 1: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1N_cSvNZRWaamyBOwtOijyH-MnmOgRaIi/v\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1N_cSvNZRWaamyBOwtOijyH-MnmOgRaIi/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1N_cSvNZRWaamyBOwtOijyH-MnmOgRaIi/view?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<p>Interview Recording 2:</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Interview Recording 2: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1lCC6wYca8Pxgqdw2sos-Bo95JdKtUsT5/v\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1lCC6wYca8Pxgqdw2sos-Bo95JdKtUsT5/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1lCC6wYca8Pxgqdw2sos-Bo95JdKtUsT5/view?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<h5>3.2. Mock Calls</h5>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"9:s3-2\"></div>\n<p><b>Intake Mock Calls Metrics</b></p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day9/img/image23.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day9/img/image23.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<p><b><i>***Free Communication Upskill for 1 or 1 ½ hours</i></b></p>"},{"id":"to-be-added","h":"To be added","placeholder":true,"html":"<div class=\"ftdd-ph ftdd-ph-blank\"><span class=\"ftdd-ph-ic\">📌</span><div><b>More for Day 9 is on its way</b><p>Your trainer will add the rest of today’s material here. Until then, follow the slides before this one and the training GC.</p></div></div>"}]},"10":{"day":10,"title":"Insurance Communication Training","heading":"DAY 10: Insurance Communication Training","slides":[{"id":"s1","h":"AM: Classroom Discussion on Insurance Communication Training and Call Listening","html":"<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"10:s1-1\"></div>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"10:s1-2\"></div>\n<div class=\"ftdd-pq\">✍️ <b>Today’s Process Questions</b> are answered in <a class=\"ftdd-link\" onclick=\"goto('process')\">✍️ Knowledge Check</a>, after the day’s activities — not here.</div>\n<p> Claims Terminology Exercise</p>\n<div class=\"canva-frame\" id=\"cvDAGvPSukyvs\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Canva\" src=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGvPSukyvs/s8w2Yn1YKOv1k1_N-pxDgw/view?embed\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" allow=\"fullscreen\"></iframe></div><div class=\"actions\"><span></span><div class=\"btn-row\"><button class=\"btn ghost\" type=\"button\" data-fullscreen=\"cvDAGvPSukyvs\">⛶ Full screen</button><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGvPSukyvs/s8w2Yn1YKOv1k1_N-pxDgw/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open in Canva ↗</a></div></div>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"10:s1-3\"></div>\n<p><b>Additional Information:</b></p>\n<p>If you’re opening a claim or checking for an existing claim with the 3P&#x27;s insurance, please take note of the following:</p>\n<p><b>Do NOT share the following sensitive information:</b></p>\n<p>Date of Birth (DOB)</p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">1.</span><span>Email Address</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">2.</span><span>Social Security Number (SSN)</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">3.</span><span>Vehicle Identification Number (VIN)</span></p>\n<p><b>What you CAN share:</b></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">1.</span><span>Client’s Name (First and Last only – no middle name)</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">2.</span><span>Vehicle Information (e.g., License Plate Number)</span></p>\n<p><b>To check under the 3P insurance, you may also provide:</b></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Client’s Address (City and State only)</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Phone Number (Give the law firm’s number)</span></p>\n<p><i>Note:</i></p>\n<p>The pieces of information you’re allowed to share are typically available in the police report, something the adjuster would likely already have access to </p>\n<p>Sample Insurance Communication-Related Documents and VA Recordings</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Sample Insurance Communication-Related Documents and VA Recordings https://drive.google.co\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/14jCcagQ9mGag2DyRxFPCN-bWds5tl_bU?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/14jCcagQ9mGag2DyRxFPCN-bWds5tl_bU?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p><b>VA Call Recordings: Opening Claims/Checking For Existing Claims </b></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-v5NyBlz4dupb3L6aMx4PWRdyx5iAIAr?usp=drive_link, h\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-v5NyBlz4dupb3L6aMx4PWRdyx5iAIAr?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-v5NyBlz4dupb3L6aMx4PWRdyx5iAIAr?usp=drive_link</a>,<a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-v5NyBlz4dupb3L6aMx4PWRdyx5iAIAr?usp=drive_link, h\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15OCezerotGu4tql8gOOxleQYN4uVSWJJ?usp=drive_link\"> https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15OCezerotGu4tql8gOOxleQYN4uVSWJJ?usp=drive_link</a> </p>"},{"id":"s2","h":"PM: Insurance Communication Videos and Articles Review Tasks","html":"<p>For your tasks this afternoon, kindly go over these videos and the job aid or work guide article for additional reference. If you don&#x27;t manage to finish them, you can watch them during your idle time. Thank you. </p>\n<p><b>OPENING CLAIMS &amp; SENDING LOR</b></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"OPENING CLAIMS &amp; SENDING LOR https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wN9gMcmp7YVOIjGJLItSWl_4wbFa\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wN9gMcmp7YVOIjGJLItSWl_4wbFarIz4/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wN9gMcmp7YVOIjGJLItSWl_4wbFarIz4/view?usp=sharing</a> </p>\n<p><b>SAMPLE OPENING A CLAIM W/ 3P ZURICH</b></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"SAMPLE OPENING A CLAIM W/ 3P ZURICH https://drive.google.com/file/d/1W86a49udA9MqS2v4HuUDA\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1W86a49udA9MqS2v4HuUDAEi6MXMaLBpo/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1W86a49udA9MqS2v4HuUDAEi6MXMaLBpo/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p><b>TOOLS OVERVIEW BY CYREL ALEGADO </b></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"TOOLS OVERVIEW BY CYREL ALEGADO https://drive.google.com/file/d/18FUTlC2dl0blz_MoLLGPoQrwP\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/18FUTlC2dl0blz_MoLLGPoQrwP3ysYfrm/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/18FUTlC2dl0blz_MoLLGPoQrwP3ysYfrm/view?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<p><b>FAMILIARIZING INTAKE DOCUMENTS </b></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"FAMILIARIZING INTAKE DOCUMENTS https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KzHQdSRugd53_puQXYWu4moiza\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KzHQdSRugd53_puQXYWu4moizaMeCRz3/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KzHQdSRugd53_puQXYWu4moizaMeCRz3/view?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<p><b>OBTAINING COVERAGE INFORMATION</b></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"OBTAINING COVERAGE INFORMATION https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LrxtH7zguRVMpcE-6IJbAz366V\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LrxtH7zguRVMpcE-6IJbAz366VyfkW1Y/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LrxtH7zguRVMpcE-6IJbAz366VyfkW1Y/view?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p>Kindly go over this job aid or work guide article during your idle time for additional reference</p>\n<p><b>HOW TO OPEN A 3P AUTO INSURANCE CLAIM &amp; SENDING LOR  - VLF’s SOP </b></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"HOW TO OPEN A 3P AUTO INSURANCE CLAIM &amp; SENDING LOR - VLF’s SOP https://drive.google.com/f\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cBIq48EPE4kUxJXRPGISPhpl61Jsb-gN/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cBIq48EPE4kUxJXRPGISPhpl61Jsb-gN/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p><b><i>*** Free Communication Upskill for 1 or 1 ½ hours</i></b></p>"},{"id":"to-be-added","h":"To be added","placeholder":true,"html":"<div class=\"ftdd-ph ftdd-ph-blank\"><span class=\"ftdd-ph-ic\">📌</span><div><b>More for Day 10 is on its way</b><p>Your trainer will add the rest of today’s material here. Until then, follow the slides before this one and the training GC.</p></div></div>"}]},"11":{"day":11,"title":"Insurance Communication Training","heading":"DAY 11: Insurance Communication Training","slides":[{"id":"s1","h":"AM: Insurance Communication Activities","html":"<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"11:s1-1\"></div>\n<p>Proceed to the assessment activity designed to evaluate your understanding of key responsibilities as an Insurance Claim Specialist.</p>\n<p><b>Policy Disclosure, Claim &amp; Liability Evaluation</b></p>\n<p>Objective: To assess your ability to accurately review, analyze, interpret, and extract relevant insurance policy information from Dec Pages (Declarations Pages), demonstrate an understanding of insurance coverages, fault, negligence, and liability, and apply this knowledge to the claim-handling process, including identifying the essential information and documentation required to open a claim.</p>\n<p>This evaluation consists of 2 components:</p>\n<p><b>1. Policy Disclosure</b></p>\n<p>-- Reference: Use the <b>zipped file containing the Dec Page</b> as your source material.</p>\n<p><b>2. Claim &amp; Liability Evaluation</b></p>\n<p>-- Complete this component based on your understanding of the concepts and processes covered during training.</p>\n<p><b>Important:</b> Before starting the evaluation, <b>download all required files</b> and make sure you are referring to the correct Dec Page for each Policy Disclosure activity. </p>\n<p>Thank you.</p>\n<p>Assessment Activities</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Assessment Activities https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LX_skojUHS2NbxKMd_lrJvfiXuFZ\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LX_skojUHS2NbxKMd_lrJvfiXuFZI2bD?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LX_skojUHS2NbxKMd_lrJvfiXuFZI2bD?usp=sharing</a><u> </u></p>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"11:s1-2\"></div>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p>As soon as you’re done with Activities 1 &amp; 2 of your Claim and Liability Evaluation, please proceed right away to drafting your LORs. </p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day11/img/image26.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day11/img/image26.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"11:s1-3\"></div>\n<p>LOR Drafting Activity (Guidelines and Instructions):</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"LOR Drafting Activity (Guidelines and Instructions): https://drive.google.com/file/d/11N15\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/11N15MFcvSedCvByQ4GqHqt9BKZqlSxVu/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/11N15MFcvSedCvByQ4GqHqt9BKZqlSxVu/view?usp=sharing</a> </p>\n<p>1P LOR Template</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"download all required files\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1aRMbhtBTZ3wxDDo5Ww1sERL5frjdNNHw/edit?usp=sharing&amp;amp;amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;amp;amp;rtpof=true&amp;amp;amp;sd=true\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1aRMbhtBTZ3wxDDo5Ww1sERL5frjdNNHw/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true</a> </p>\n<p>3P LOR Template</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"DAY 11: Insurance Communication Training\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/10Nz45QtxH3O6RSBH3A83sl_RpUJ-rF0P/edit?usp=sharing&amp;amp;amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;amp;amp;rtpof=true&amp;amp;amp;sd=true\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/10Nz45QtxH3O6RSBH3A83sl_RpUJ-rF0P/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true</a> </p>\n<p>Case Notes</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"DAY 11: Insurance Communication Training\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/16pAsNo35SkAMlqwhMQR5wE-xJ5oMZbsK/edit?usp=sharing&amp;amp;amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;amp;amp;rtpof=true&amp;amp;amp;sd=true\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/16pAsNo35SkAMlqwhMQR5wE-xJ5oMZbsK/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=107426275770887856664&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true</a></p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"11:s1-4\"></div>\n<p><b>Additional Reminders for Drafting Your LOR:</b></p>\n<p>• Clarification on “F/E”: “F/E” stands for Fax or Email. Refer to your case notes for the available method of sending.</p>\n<p>• In the recipient’s address section, update the line that says “SENT VIA FACSIMILE AND E-MAIL” by keeping only the method you selected (either Facsimile or E-mail) and removing the other.</p>\n<p>• In the “F/E” part, replace it with the actual fax number or email address you’ll be using to send the letter.</p>\n<p> <b>Before saving your LOR in your Assessments folder:</b></p>\n<p>• Review thoroughly for completeness and correctness.</p>\n<p>• Ensure proper formal letter formatting, including:</p>\n<p>        -Correct spacing</p>\n<p>        -Proper layout of the recipient’s address section</p>\n<p>        -Consistent font and alignment</p>\n<p> •  Follow the specific instructions listed in the activity sheet, especially on what must be checked, updated, or edited.</p>\n<p>Lastly, keep in mind that these letters will be sent to insurance companies.</p>\n<p>Make sure your final draft is:</p>\n<p>       •  Clear</p>\n<p>       •  Accurate</p>\n<p>       •  Professionally written</p>\n<p>❗ There should be <b>NO</b> highlighted texts left in your final output. ❗</p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"11:s1-5\"></div>"},{"id":"s2","h":"PM: Shadowing","html":"<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"11:s2-1\"></div>\n<p><b>Note: </b>If no shadowing buddy is available, recorded shadowing video/s will be provided to trainees instead.</p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p><b>@everyone</b> Kindly update this section of your TAM after the session. Thanks.</p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day11/img/image32.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day11/img/image32.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p><b>Note:</b> To be given in lieu if the shadow buddy is not available for a shadowing.</p>\n<p><b>SHADOWING ASTRED 09/20: INTAKE SUPPORT &amp; PI CLAIMS SPECIALIST ROLES</b></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"SHADOWING ASTRED 09/20: INTAKE SUPPORT &amp; PI CLAIMS SPECIALIST ROLES https://drive.google.c\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fbrRvkeisnNF7EfVxCKTGtEodR7MY0A8/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fbrRvkeisnNF7EfVxCKTGtEodR7MY0A8/view?usp=dri</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"ve_link\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fbrRvkeisnNF7EfVxCKTGtEodR7MY0A8/view?usp=drive_link\">ve_link</a></p>\n<p><b><i>*** Free Communication Upskill for 1 or 1 ½ hours</i></b></p>"},{"id":"to-be-added","h":"To be added","placeholder":true,"html":"<div class=\"ftdd-ph ftdd-ph-blank\"><span class=\"ftdd-ph-ic\">📌</span><div><b>More for Day 11 is on its way</b><p>Your trainer will add the rest of today’s material here. Until then, follow the slides before this one and the training GC.</p></div></div>"}]},"12":{"day":12,"title":"Insurance Communication Training","heading":"DAY 12: Insurance Communication Training","slides":[{"id":"s1","h":"Entire Day: Recorded Demonstration - Uploading and Sending 1P & 3P LORs","html":"<p><b><i>Tutorial Demo Recording on Saving LORs to SA and Sending to 1P &amp; 3P Insurance Companies</i></b></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Tutorial Demo Recording on Saving LORs to SA and Sending to 1P &amp; 3P Insurance Companies ht\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zLB0gIWZpMCozH2U3hpw8qmgKtvcjO9W/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zLB0gIWZpMCozH2U3hpw8qmgKtvcjO9W/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p>@everyone </p>\n<p>When creating your process guide for your Saving LORs to SA and Sending to 3P &amp; 1P Ins Companies Demo, please incorporate these additional and updated steps, as they are already available in SA, particularly when entering insurance information for both 1P and 3P. </p>\n<p><b>ADDING 1P and 3P INSURANCE INFORMATION</b> </p>\n<p><b>For BOTH 1P and 3P insurance entries, make sure to complete the following fields:</b></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Policy Number</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Claim Number</span></p>\n<p><b>When adding the 1P insurance information:</b></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>In the <b>Plaintiff Insurance Owner Field</b>, select: <b>Plaintiff&#x27;s Training Acct</b></span></p>\n<p><b>In the Comments section, include the following:</b></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Actual insurance name of the owner</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Assigned adjuster details</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>If no adjuster has been assigned yet, indicate: <b><i>“No adjuster assigned yet.”</i></b></span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Still add all other available insurance information even if no adjuster has been assigned.</span></p>\n<p><b>When adding the 3P insurance information:</b></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>In the <b>Defendant Insurance Owner field</b>, select: <b>OWNER, FAKE</b></span></p>\n<p><b>In the Comments section, include the following:</b></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Actual insurance name of the owner</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Driver’s name, if different from the owner</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Assigned adjuster details</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>If no adjuster has been assigned yet, indicate: “<b><i>No adjuster assigned yet.</i></b>”</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Still add all other available 3P insurance information even if no adjuster has been assigned.</span></p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p>Please take note and include these reminders &amp; updates in your notes/work guide. </p>\n<p><b>Tools:</b></p>\n<p>1. CMS: Smart Advocate</p>\n<p>2. Notepad</p>\n<p>3. Nitro Pro (pdf editing tool)</p>\n<p>---------------------</p>\n<p><b>Complete Naming Convention: </b></p>\n<p>INS – 1P/3P Insurance Provider - LOR mm.dd.yy (VA&#x27;s name)</p>\n<p><b>Samples:</b></p>\n<p>INS – 1P State Farm – LOR 02.17.2026 (Michelle) </p>\n<p>INS – 3P Geico – LOR with Affidavit 02.17.2026 (Michelle)</p>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"12:s1-1\"></div>\n<h4>Saving LORs to SA and Sending to 1P &amp; 3P Insurance Companies Metrics</h4>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day12/img/image27.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day12/img/image27.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<p><b><i>*** Free Communication Upskill for 1 or 1 ½ hours</i></b></p>"},{"id":"to-be-added","h":"To be added","placeholder":true,"html":"<div class=\"ftdd-ph ftdd-ph-blank\"><span class=\"ftdd-ph-ic\">📌</span><div><b>More for Day 12 is on its way</b><p>Your trainer will add the rest of today’s material here. Until then, follow the slides before this one and the training GC.</p></div></div>"}]},"13":{"day":13,"title":"Provider Communication Training","heading":"DAY 13: Provider Communication Training","slides":[{"id":"s1","h":"AM: Buffer Time (1–2 hrs) for LOR Drafting Demo","html":"<p>Carryover period for completing the demo.  </p>"},{"id":"s2","h":"AM: Classroom Discussion on Medical Records Specialist Role and Call Listening","html":"<div class=\"canva-frame\" id=\"medRecordsRoleFrame\">\n  <iframe\n    loading=\"lazy\"\n    title=\"The Medical Records Specialist Role (Canva)\"\n    src=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGtiDcg6Rg/vf5ko9Ac9ayCD6mA0TsC7Q/view?embed\"\n    allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"\n    allow=\"fullscreen\">\n  </iframe>\n</div>\n<div class=\"actions\">\n  <span></span>\n  <div class=\"btn-row\">\n    <button class=\"btn ghost\" type=\"button\" data-fullscreen=\"medRecordsRoleFrame\">⛶ Full screen</button>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGtiDcg6Rg/vf5ko9Ac9ayCD6mA0TsC7Q/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open in Canva ↗</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"13:s2-1\"></div>"},{"id":"s3","h":"PM: Breakout Session","html":"<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"13:s3-1\"></div>\n<div class=\"ftdd-pq\">✍️ <b>Today’s Process Questions</b> are answered in <a class=\"ftdd-link\" onclick=\"goto('process')\">✍️ Knowledge Check</a>, after the day’s activities — not here.</div>\n<p><b>Document Detectives Exercise</b></p>\n<div class=\"canva-frame\" id=\"cvDAGvaFyDPHo\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Canva\" src=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGvaFyDPHo/DXv2IzUJscIB_JMVcyVUSQ/view?embed\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" allow=\"fullscreen\"></iframe></div><div class=\"actions\"><span></span><div class=\"btn-row\"><button class=\"btn ghost\" type=\"button\" data-fullscreen=\"cvDAGvaFyDPHo\">⛶ Full screen</button><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGvaFyDPHo/DXv2IzUJscIB_JMVcyVUSQ/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open in Canva ↗</a></div></div>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day13/img/image34.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day13/img/image34.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/ft/day13/img/image30.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day13/img/image30.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"13:s3-2\"></div>\n<p><b>Sample recordings &amp; documents for your reference</b></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Sample recordings &amp; documents for your reference https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/17\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/17_v7RMsD93ebLoq9mu7srIqkcxEL-Egk?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/17_v7RMsD93ebLoq9mu7srIqkcxEL-Egk?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<p><b>HIPAA Certificate Task</b></p>\n<p>Please watch the HIPAA Training 101 series of short videos and complete all the modules. After completing the entire series, take a screenshot of the final page of the last video, making sure the timestamp is visible, as proof of completion. Once done, please DM the screenshot to Michelle.</p>\n<p><b>Naming Convention:  </b>HIPAA Certificate_[Your Name]</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://compliancy-group.com/free-hipaa-training/hipaa-introduction/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://compliancy-group.com/free-hipaa-training/hipaa-introduction/</a> </p>\n<p>Thank you.  </p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day13/img/image22.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day13/img/image22.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<p><b><i>*** Free Communication Upskill for 1 or 1 ½ hours</i></b></p>"},{"id":"to-be-added","h":"To be added","placeholder":true,"html":"<div class=\"ftdd-ph ftdd-ph-blank\"><span class=\"ftdd-ph-ic\">📌</span><div><b>More for Day 13 is on its way</b><p>Your trainer will add the rest of today’s material here. Until then, follow the slides before this one and the training GC.</p></div></div>"}]},"14":{"day":14,"title":"Provider Communication Training","heading":"DAY 14: Provider Communication Training","slides":[{"id":"s1","h":"AM: Tutorial Video - Sending MedLOR (Medical Letter of Representation) and Requesting for Medical Bills & Records","html":"<p>Please proceed to watch the tutorial video and learn how we, here at VLF handle the process of sending MedLOR and requesting medical bills and records. </p>\n<p><b>Topic: Sending MedLOR (Medical Letter of Representation) and Requesting for Medical Bills &amp; Records</b></p>\n<p>Tutorial Video:</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Tutorial Video: https://drive.google.com/file/d/16Oy2X1S9nokz5tqMm_P6nByqYaakvGDU/view?usp\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/16Oy2X1S9nokz5tqMm_P6nByqYaakvGDU/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/16Oy2X1S9nokz5tqMm_P6nByqYaakvGDU/view?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<p>NOTE:  While watching the tutorial video, create your own notes or work guide so that you have something to refer to during your recorded demonstration. Additionally, please skip [Time stamp range 58:12-58:45 mins] in the video. Thank you.</p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<h4>Please take note and include these reminders &amp; updates in your notes/work guide. </h4>\n<p><b>Tools:</b></p>\n<p>1. CMS: Smart Advocate</p>\n<p>2. Notepad</p>\n<p>3. Nitro Pro (pdf editing tool)</p>\n<p>---------------------</p>\n<p><b>Complete Naming Convention: </b></p>\n<p>MED - Lien Holder(Medical Provider) - MedLOR with Unsworn COR and HIPAA mm.dd.yy (va’s first name)</p>\n<p>Example:</p>\n<p>MED - JML(Lyons Physical Therapy) - MedLOR with Unsworn COR and HIPAA 08.11.22 (John)</p>\n<p>---------------------</p>\n<p><b>Please add these in your notes. </b></p>\n<p>1. HIPAA Form</p>\n<p>*Validity of Authorization Form - Enter the date when the client signed the form, as indicated below the document </p>\n<p>*Relationship to Patient – Self</p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day14/img/image25.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day14/img/image25.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<p>---------------------</p>\n<p>2. In MedLOR </p>\n<p>- tick the appropriate box (for bills &amp; records) as indicated in your request</p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day14/img/image46.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day14/img/image46.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<p>---------------------</p>\n<p>3. Naming convention for NPIM (Nevada Personal Injury Management) doctors</p>\n<p>- indicate the name of the doctor</p>\n<p>Example:</p>\n<p>MED - JML(Fabito Anesthesia Pain Center Dr. Fabito) - MedLOR with Unsworn COR and HIPAA 08.11.22 (John)</p>\n<p>---------------------</p>\n<p>4. <b>Sending request: E-mail/E-filing</b></p>\n<p>Subject Line:   </p>\n<p>Name of the client - Name of the lien holder(medical provider) - Type of Request</p>\n<p>Jane Doe - JML(Fabito Anesthesia Pain Center Dr. Fabito) - Request for Medical Bills and Records</p>\n<p>---------------------</p>\n<p><b>Provider - Nevada Personal Injury Management (NPIM)</b></p>\n<p><b>List of doctors under NPIM</b></p>\n<p>- Dr. Brian Le</p>\n<p>- Dr. Thomas Yee</p>\n<p>- Dr. Daniel Fabito</p>\n<p>- Dr. Anthony Ruggeroli</p>\n<p>- Dr. Quan Haduong</p>\n<p>- Dr. Sudhir Khemka</p>\n<p>- Dr. Virginia Hardie</p>\n<p>- Dr. Arlyn Valencia (Neurologist)</p>\n<p>- Dr. George Tsao</p>\n<p>- Dr. Alexander Lee</p>\n<p>- Dr. Steven Olenchak</p>\n<p>- Dr. Dana Clark</p>\n<p>- Dr. Ruben Alexander</p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p><b>Here are the first 5 steps of the process guide as your sample. Feel free to format the guide according to your preference</b></p>\n<p><b>SENDING MEDLOR AND REQUEST FOR BILLS &amp; RECORDS</b></p>\n<p>1. Verify the Correct Client Case / Matter in SA: Before doing any work in SmartAdvocate, always ensure that you are on the correct client project or matter before proceeding.</p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Confirm the client’s full name and case number.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>Verify that you are inside the correct case/matter of the client in SmartAdvocate.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>If the client has multiple matters, verify the DOL to ensure you are working on the correct project.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span>For training demo purposes, you should narrate that you are verifying the correct matter, assuming the verification step even if you are using a training account or dummy matter.</span></p>\n<p>2. Check the assigned task in the TASK MENU of the client in Smart Advocate, or the task could be emailed by Case Manager or the Attorney, especially if it is urgent.</p>\n<p>3. Check the details of the task by double-clicking on it anywhere in the row, and you will find all the necessary information about your task in the DESCRIPTION BOX.</p>\n<p>copy and paste it into your notepad to avoid revisiting this section in case you forget some details.</p>\n<p>Take note of the name of the medical provider</p>\n<p>4. Go to the PLAINTIFF Section and click plaintiff&#x27;s name to be routed to its contact card or click the dropdown arrow beside the case number.</p>\n<p>Note the complete name, DOB, Home-Primary Phone Number, Home-Primary Address &amp; SSN.</p>\n<p>5. Kindly also obtain the  DOL of the client in the summary page.</p>\n<p><b>How to find the DOL/DOI/DOA</b></p>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day14/img/image51.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day14/img/image51.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p><b>Gentle Reminders:</b></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span><b>Time Management &amp; Efficiency Metric:</b> The ideal time for completing the demo is 1 hour and 45 minutes. Any time beyond 1 hour and 45 minutes will result in a deduction from your performance rating. Please manage your time accordingly.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span><b>Preferred Document Tool:</b> For documents, please preferably use <b>Microsoft Word</b> to ensure compatibility with our templates and to avoid formatting or editing issues when working on the MedLOR.</span></p>\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">•</span><span><b>PDF Editor Requirement:</b> If you do not have Nitro Pro PDF Editor, make sure you have another PDF editor that is capable of merging files, adding text, and editing existing text. This will prevent issues during your demo and avoid wasting time addressing these issues during your demos. </span></p>\n<p><b>Please resolve any tool-related issues before your scheduled demo.</b> Do not wait until the demo starts to troubleshoot or install the necessary tools, as this may affect your completion time and result in an unnecessary deduction.</p>\n<p>Thank you for your cooperation and preparation.</p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p>@everyone</p>\n<p>FYI – Current SmartAdvocate (SA) Updates</p>\n<p><b>Please take note of the following current updates in Smart Advocate (SA) before proceeding with the demo.</b></p>\n<p><b>1. MEDS Tab Location Has Changed</b></p>\n<p>The MEDS tab is NO LONGER located under the PLAINTIFF section. It is now located under the GENERAL section.</p>\n<p>Therefore, for this demo, ALL THE TABS you will be using are located under the GENERAL section.</p>\n<p>You may still use the PLAINTIFF section if you need to access the client’s contact card by clicking the hyperlinked plaintiff’s name.</p>\n<p><b>2. Client Contact Card Has Been Updated.</b></p>\n<p>VLF has made changes to the client contact card.</p>\n<p>In the tutorial video, John Test Doe and the corresponding client/index information were used as the sample client for the training account. However, the details currently shown in the training account have been updated.</p>\n<p><b>For the DOCGEN DUMMY ACCOUNT training account, continue using the client name John Test Doe when completing the documents. However, use the current client index details shown in the updated contact card for all other information.</b></p>\n<p><b>NOTE: The current client name displayed in the training account is “I Test Doe.” For the purposes of this demo, use John Test Doe as the client name in your MedLOR and HIPAA documents, while using the updated client index details from the contact card.</b></p>\n<p><b>Important: Do not simply copy the information shown in the tutorial video. Always refer to the current contact card for the updated client details.</b></p>\n<p><b>3. Update the Client Information in Your Documents</b></p>\n<p>Because the current client details have changed, you will need to edit the applicable sections of your MedLOR and HIPAA documents to reflect the updated information.</p>\n<p>This portion may not have been demonstrated in the tutorial video, but it is an important part of the actual workflow.</p>\n<p><b>4. Why Is This Important?</b></p>\n<p>In actual tasks, there may be instances where updated client information – such as a phone number or address, is not automatically populated in a template, particularly when there is a system glitch or other issue.</p>\n<p>This is why you should always review and verify all information before finalizing a document, even when you are using a template or previously prepared information.</p>\n<p>Do not assume that information is correct simply because it was automatically populated. Always compare the document against the current information in SmartAdvocate and make the necessary corrections.</p>\n<p><b>Please be guided accordingly and make sure to incorporate these updates into the relevant sections of your process guide and apply them during the demo.</b></p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<p class=\"li\" style=\"--lvl:0\"><span class=\"lbl\">1.</span><span><b>PM: </b><b><i>Demo and Shadowing</i></b></span></p>\n<p><b><i>Recorded Demonstration - Sending MedLOR (Medical Letter of Representation) and Requesting for Medical Bills &amp; Records</i></b></p>\n<h4>Demo Metrics</h4>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day14/img/image55.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day14/img/image55.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"14:s1-1\"></div>\n<h3>6. All trainees must be fully prepared to perform their scheduled demonstrations. Any missed demonstration due to unpreparedness will be considered a missed performance and will NOT be rescheduled under any circumstance.</h3>\n<h3>The only valid reason for rescheduling a demonstration is when the delay is due to a Training Team factor, such as lack of time during the session, unexpected scheduling conflicts initiated by the training team, or technical limitations.</h3>\n<hr class=\"stars\">"},{"id":"s2","h":"PM: Shadowing Session","html":"<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"14:s2-1\"></div>\n<p><b>Note: </b>If no shadowing buddy is available, recorded shadowing video/s will be provided to trainees instead.</p>\n<p><b><i>*** Free Communication Upskill for 1 or 1 ½ hours</i></b></p>"},{"id":"to-be-added","h":"To be added","placeholder":true,"html":"<div class=\"ftdd-ph ftdd-ph-blank\"><span class=\"ftdd-ph-ic\">📌</span><div><b>More for Day 14 is on its way</b><p>Your trainer will add the rest of today’s material here. Until then, follow the slides before this one and the training GC.</p></div></div>"}]},"15":{"day":15,"title":"Provider Communication Training","heading":"DAY 15: Provider Communication Training","slides":[{"id":"s1","h":"Entire Day: Recorded Demonstration - Sending MedLOR (Medical Letter of Representation) and Requesting for Medical Bills & Records","html":"<h3>Demo Metrics</h3>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day15/img/image55.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day15/img/image55.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>"},{"id":"s2","h":"PM: Shadowing Session","html":"<p><b><i>*** Free Communication Upskill for 1 or 1 ½ hours</i></b></p>"},{"id":"to-be-added","h":"To be added","placeholder":true,"html":"<div class=\"ftdd-ph ftdd-ph-blank\"><span class=\"ftdd-ph-ic\">📌</span><div><b>More for Day 15 is on its way</b><p>Your trainer will add the rest of today’s material here. Until then, follow the slides before this one and the training GC.</p></div></div>"}]},"16":{"day":16,"title":"Provider Communication Training","heading":"DAY 16: Provider Communication Training","slides":[{"id":"s1","h":"AM: Tutorial Video – Lien Balance Verification Request","html":"<p><b>Topic: Lien Balance Verification Request</b></p>\n<p>Tutorial Video: </p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"Tutorial Video: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wRXRh8TySsosyxurXzhtCYwbXDJyN9A9/view?usp\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wRXRh8TySsosyxurXzhtCYwbXDJyN9A9/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wRXRh8TySsosyxurXzhtCYwbXDJyN9A9/view?usp=sharing</a> </p>\n<p>NOTE: Please don&#x27;t forget to take down notes for your guide later.</p>\n<hr class=\"stars\">\n<h4>Please add these in your notes. </h4>\n<p><b>Naming convention for Lien Balance Verification</b></p>\n<p>MED – Lien Holder(Provider) –  Lien Balance Verification mm.dd.yyyy (va’s first name)</p>\n<p><b>Note:</b>  For NPIM, always put the name of the doctor after the medical provider&#x27;s name.  </p>\n<p>Example:</p>\n<p>MED - RDG(NPIM Dr. Fabito) - Lien Balance Verification 08.17.2022 (jane)</p>\n<p><b>-----------------</b></p>\n<p><b>Templates </b></p>\n<p>Report Format on Notes tab:</p>\n<p>Sent filename w/o va&#x27;s name. Saved in Meds and Docs tab. Thank you. (va&#x27;s first name)</p>\n<p><b>Note:</b> Highlight the filename, right click and paste the internal link. </p>\n<p>Report Format on Tasks tab:</p>\n<p>mm/dd/yyyy Sent LV request to <u>lien holder(medical provider)</u>. Saved in Meds and Docs tab. Thank you. (va&#x27;s first name)</p>\n<p><b>-----------------</b></p>\n<p><b>Sending request: E-mail/E-filing</b></p>\n<p>Subject Line:  </p>\n<p>Name of the client - Name of the lien holder(medical provider) - Request for Lien Verification</p>"},{"id":"s2","h":"PM: Demo and Shadowing","html":"<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"16:s2-1\"></div>\n<p>Please be reminded to type &#x27;done&#x27; here as soon as you are done watching the video and have finalized your process guide. Thank you.</p>\n<p><b>2. </b>Ensure that the sequence of tasks is rearranged for the next batch of trainees&#x27; consumption OR create a new set of tasks from the different providers stored in the same link or folder before posting them on SA.</p>\n<p>LV Demo Tasks</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"video\" data-title=\"LV Demo Tasks https://drive.google.com/file/d/1r8gKLLfgtZQK9ZX_3bm1Wb4cKecGVN3b/view?usp=s\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1r8gKLLfgtZQK9ZX_3bm1Wb4cKecGVN3b/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1r8gKLLfgtZQK9ZX_3bm1Wb4cKecGVN3b/view?usp=sharing</a> </p>\n<p>Letter Templates for Training Demos</p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Letter Templates for Training Demos https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PzTwA1I-qBgkN8\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PzTwA1I-qBgkN8v7r6DdVMgdBzxD93fQ?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PzTwA1I-qBgkN8v7r6DdVMgdBzxD93fQ?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<p><b>3.</b> DM the LV Letter request of the provider assigned to each trainee before their turn for the demonstration.</p>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"16:s2-2\"></div>\n<p>While waiting for your turn to perform, you may watch the following recorded demos below. Thank you.</p>\n<p>Sending Lien Balance Verification request using SA.     </p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Sending Lien Balance Verification request using SA. https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Q55zh\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Q55zhsC-Oi2A1kQSo-CoBr3C7DsFmFmv/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Q55zhsC-Oi2A1kQSo-CoBr3C7DsFmFmv/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p>Sending MedLOR using Filevine: </p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Sending MedLOR using Filevine: https://drive.google.com/file/d/11mvVFbtzbWIVcKM0XwVm_lp11_\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/11mvVFbtzbWIVcKM0XwVm_lp11_5mbseR/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/11mvVFbtzbWIVcKM0XwVm_lp11_5mbseR/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Sending MedLOR using Filevine: https://drive.google.com/file/d/13DGgCl5S_FjCUBoj-Oo65_68lB\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/13DGgCl5S_FjCUBoj-Oo65_68lBrwZz3u/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/13DGgCl5S_FjCUBoj-Oo65_68lBrwZz3u/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p>Sending Lien Balance Verification request using Filevine: <a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Sending Lien Balance Verification request using Filevine: https://drive.google.com/file/d/\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BAp24F_I3JgycQfZK0-6lZdmsYSVRS0-/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BAp24F_I3JgycQfZK0-6lZdmsYSVRS0-/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Sending Lien Balance Verification request using Filevine: https://drive.google.com/file/d/\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zPnBl5qN4ltX7GBJefTxg5SlHwTi-EJU/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zPnBl5qN4ltX7GBJefTxg5SlHwTi-EJU/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"viewer-link\" data-kind=\"doc\" data-title=\"Sending Lien Balance Verification request using Filevine: https://drive.google.com/file/d/\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rLEotcYvyl4-oXBGJNKgnwKez1McCb4L/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rLEotcYvyl4-oXBGJNKgnwKez1McCb4L/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<div class=\"trainer-slot\" data-slot=\"16:s2-3\"></div>\n<h3>5. All trainees must be fully prepared to perform their scheduled demonstrations. Any missed demonstration due to unpreparedness will be considered a missed performance and will NOT be rescheduled under any circumstance.</h3>\n<p>The only valid reason for rescheduling a demonstration is when the delay is due to a Training Team factor, such as lack of time during the session, unexpected scheduling conflicts initiated by the training team, or technical limitations.</p>\n<h4>6. Demo Metrics</h4>\n<div class=\"shots\"><figure><a href=\"/ft/day16/img/image53.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/ft/day16/img/image53.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div>\n<p>@everyone</p>\n<p>Please be informed that for the last metric of your LV Demo, Time Management &amp; Efficiency, the ideal completion time is 45 minutes. Going beyond the allotted time will result in a significant deduction under this metric. Please be guided and manage your time accordingly.</p>\n<p><b><i>*** Free Communication Upskill for 1 or 1 ½ hours </i></b></p>"},{"id":"to-be-added","h":"To be added","placeholder":true,"html":"<div class=\"ftdd-ph ftdd-ph-blank\"><span class=\"ftdd-ph-ic\">📌</span><div><b>More for Day 16 is on its way</b><p>Your trainer will add the rest of today’s material here. Until then, follow the slides before this one and the training GC.</p></div></div>"}]}};
